2. In your fragment's onCreateView() method, inflate the layout that contains the toolbar.
3. Find the toolbar view by its ID using findViewById().
4. Set the toolbar as the support action bar for your fragment using setHasOptionsMenu(true) and setSupportActionbar(toolbar).
