### 2. Update Your Form Action

In your form action, call the appropriate function to remove the note from the store and then redirect back to the page where the notes are displayed.

#### Example Form Action:
```javascript
// routes/+page.server.js
import { deleteNote } from '../stores'; // Adjust path as necessary

export async function DELETE({ params }) {
    const { id } = params;
    deleteNote(id);
    return new Response(null, { status: 303, headers: { Location: '/' } });
}
